ase.","startMs":20540,"endMs":23320},{"text":"A patch makes a weak test pass by hiding","startMs":23320,"endMs":25860},{"text":"an authentication failure instead of preventing expired credentials from","startMs":25860,"endMs":29780},{"text":"authenticating.","startMs":29780,"endMs":31820},{"text":"A faster search endpoint is our third case.","startMs":31820,"endMs":35180},{"text":"One quick request is presented as evidence of improved","startMs":35180,"endMs":38060},{"text":"tail latency, without a defined workload or failed-request accounting.","startMs":38060,"endMs":43000},{"text":"These cases show that a check can be precise","startMs":43000,"endMs":45320},{"text":"and still ask the wrong question.","startMs":45320,"endMs":48360},{"text":"The scenario's scores and outcomes are illustrative, not a","startMs":48360,"endMs":51960},{"text":"measured result for a production system.","startMs":51960,"endMs":53820},{"text":"Our governing question is: what evidence would distinguish a","startMs":53820,"endMs":58300},{"text":"good result from a convincing failure?","startMs":58300,"endMs":61540},{"text":"We will map requirements to evidence, test whether checks","startMs":61540,"endMs":64940},{"text":"detect the intended defects, calibrate residual judgment, and manage","startMs":64940,"endMs":69340},{"text":"scope changes without losing valid work.","startMs":69340,"endMs":72060},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to specify","startMs":72060,"endMs":74620},{"text":"an observable outcome while stating what a passing check","startMs":74620,"endMs":77860},{"text":"does and does not establish.","startMs":77860,"endMs":79920},{"text":"Human judgment can remain an explicit decision where it","startMs":79920,"endMs":83880},{"text":"is needed.","startMs":83880,"endMs":84300}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":20540,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":31820,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":44380,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":53820,"actionIndex":5}],"board